# Keep the build context small and secrets out of the image.
.git
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/.vite
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets and real household data must never enter an image layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
seed/household-nov-2026.json
seed/*.local.json
reference/
design/
docs/HANDOFF.md
headroom-handoff.zip

# Local tooling
.vscode
.idea
*.log
backups/
pgdata/
